OL,3,GNEWSABird flu outbreak confirmed at
OL,4,Apoultry farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outbreak of bird flu has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed at a poultry farm in North
OL,8,FLincolnshire.
OL,10,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,11,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said the
OL,12,Fcases were at a commercial premises
OL,13,Fnear Brigg.
OL,15,FA protection zone of about two miles
OL,16,F(3km) and an eight-mile (10km)
OL,17,Fsurveillance zone have been put in
OL,18,Fplace around the site.
OL,20,FAll birds on the premises would be
OL,21,Fhumanely culled, Defra added.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
